+Mac, their code, repo or projects, or files on their machine. Speak a brief acknowledgment
+before calling it; it often takes a minute or more, and the result may arrive as a follow-up.
+If a claude_code result asks the user to approve something by saying yes or no followed by a
+short code, read it to them, wait for their answer, and pass their exact words back as a new
+claude_code task, for example "yes k q r t x". Never answer an approval yourself."""
+
